1) Week 1: Core + Guardian + Host
- Slash, permissions, logs, onboarding flows, role menus.

2) Week 2: Engagement + Architect
- Quests, streaks, polls; automation builder v1 with 5 templates.

3) Week 3: Bard + Synth (lite)
- Music/ambient basics; summarize/translate; FAQ stub.

4) Week 4: Scout + Economy (lite)
